"[{\"unix_timestamp\": 1720124260, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNBctdkYvQOdSxGcds3GxLnSMcZF\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[The camera fades in to a bustling bar with people chatting and laughing in the background. A bartender is seen pouring a cold, refreshing beer into a glass.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Introducing the beer that brings people together, [brand name] beer. Made with only the finest ingredients and brewed with passion and expertise.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a group of friends clinking their glasses together and taking a sip of their beers, smiling and laughing.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Whether you're celebrating with friends, unwinding after a long day, or simply enjoying the moment, [brand name] beer is the perfect choice.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of the beer being poured into a glass, the golden liquid cascading down with a satisfying fizz.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"With its crisp, clean taste and smooth finish, [brand name] beer is sure to please even the most discerning beer connoisseurs.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a couple enjoying a romantic dinner with a bottle of [brand name] beer on the table.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"So why settle for anything less? Treat yourself to the best beer experience with [brand name] beer.\\\"\\n\\n[The camera pans out to reveal the logo of the brand and the tagline \\\"Cheers to Good Times.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Cheers to good times with [brand name] beer. Available now at your nearest bar or liquor store.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the sound of clinking glasses and laughter in the background.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Drink responsibly. Must be 21 or older to purchase. Please enjoy [brand name] beer responsibly.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 325}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720124265, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNBh7YUE68GgM2qVZNGd9kFjzfkc\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting chocolate\", \"response\": \"[Background musi