or demonstrating a yoga pose.]\\n\\nInstructor: Join us for our yoga class and experience the benefits of a regular yoga practice.\\n\\n[Cut to footage of participants in the class stretching, meditating, and smiling.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Our experienced instructors will guide you through a series of poses and breathing exercises that will help you build strength, flexibility, and inner peace.\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a participant talking about their experience with the class.]\\n\\nParticipant: I never thought I could feel so calm and centered after just one class. Yoga has truly changed my life.\\n\\nVoiceover: Whether you're a beginner or an experienced yogi, our classes are suitable for all levels.\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the instructor leading a group of participants in a relaxing meditation.]\\n\\nInstructor: Take a deep breath in, and exhale out any tension or stress. Allow yourself to be present in this moment.\\n\\nVoiceover: So why wait? Sign up for our yoga class today and start your journey to a healthier mind, body, and soul.\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the yoga studio logo and contact information.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Visit our website or call us to reserve your spot in our next class. Namaste.\\n\\n[Fade to black.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 314}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720125157, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNQ5fjvUG1cHx9KFuu5WuitqIjOi\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a group of people in a gym, lifting weights and sweating profusely. The camera pans to a muscular instructor, who is motivating and guiding the class.]\\n\\nInstructor: Are you looking to get stronger, fitter, and more confident? Then look no further! Join our weightlifting class and see the results for yourself.\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different people of all ages and fitness levels lifting weights, with a voiceover.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Our weightlifting class is suitab