 will guide you through each exercise, ensuring you have the right form and technique to maximize your results.\\n\\n[Cut to a group of people cheering and high-fiving each other after a successful lift]\\n\\nNarrator: Join our supportive community of fellow fitness enthusiasts and push yourself to new heights.\\n\\n[Cut to a before and after shot of a person who has transformed their body through weightlifting]\\n\\nNarrator: Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned lifter, our classes are designed for all levels. You'll be amazed at what you can achieve with our program.\\n\\n[Cut to a logo and contact information for signing up for the weightlifting class]\\n\\nNarrator: Don't wait any longer - sign up for our weightlifting class today and start your journey to a stronger, healthier you.\\n\\n[Fade to black]\\n\\nNarrator: Weightlifting - because strong is the new sexy.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 263}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720125290, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNSETcglKD1MTxCUPBGGLdCegDDj\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\", \"response\": \"[The camera pans over lush green fairways and manicured greens of a beautiful golf course. Soft piano music plays in the background as the sun sets in the distance.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Welcome to the [Name of Golf Club], where every swing is a masterpiece and every putt is a work of art.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of golfers teeing off, hitting perfect shots, and sinking long putts.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Whether you're a seasoned pro or a beginner just starting out, [Name of Golf Club] offers something for everyone.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of the clubhouse, with golfers enjoying drinks on the patio and socializing after a round of golf.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Our state-of-the-art facilities include a pro shop, driving range, putting green, and expert instructors to help you improve your game.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of families playing mini-golf and