e for yourself.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 300}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720125594, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNX848MFEadMZ263WONIfoGE6cek\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a washing machine\", \"response\": \"[The ad opens with a shot of a busy household, with piles of dirty laundry scattered around.]\\n\\nNarrator: Tired of spending your weekends drowning in laundry? Say goodbye to the hassle with our revolutionary new washing machine!\\n\\n[Cut to a sleek, modern washing machine with advanced features.]\\n\\nNarrator: Introducing the [Brand Name] washing machine - the ultimate solution for all your laundry needs. With its powerful cleaning technology, it can tackle even the toughest stains with ease.\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different types of clothes being loaded into the machine and coming out clean and fresh.]\\n\\nNarrator: From delicate silk to muddy sports gear, this washing machine can handle it all. And with its energy-efficient design, you'll save both time and money on your laundry.\\n\\n[Cut to a happy family enjoying their freshly washed clothes.]\\n\\nNarrator: Spend more time doing what you love and less time worrying about laundry. Upgrade to the [Brand Name] washing machine today!\\n\\n[End with the brand logo and slogan: \\\"Making laundry a breeze.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator: [Brand Name] - the future of clean.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 224}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720125597, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNXBwgU42d6E57JGwORsD7yq28sb\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting dishwasher tablets\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a busy kitchen, dishes piled high in the sink. A frustrated-looking woman enters the kitchen, surveying the mess.]\\n\\nNarrator: Tired of spending hours scrubbing dirty dishes? Introducing the solution you've been waiting for - dishwasher tablets!\\n\\n[The woman picks up a dishwasher tablet 