ls\", \"response\": \"[The ad opens with a close-up shot of a sleek, modern electric drill spinning in action. The camera then pans out to reveal a handyman using the drill to effortlessly drive screws into a piece of wood.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Tired of struggling with manual tools that just don't cut it? Introducing the all-new electric drill, the ultimate solution for all your drilling needs!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different scenarios where the electric drill comes in handy, such as assembling furniture, hanging shelves, and completing DIY projects.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"With its powerful motor and ergonomic design, our electric drill makes any task a breeze. Say goodbye to sore arms and wasted time \\u2013 get the job done quickly and efficiently with our electric drill!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a satisfied customer giving a testimonial about how the electric drill has transformed their DIY experience.]\\n\\nCustomer: \\\"I used to dread tackling home improvement projects, but ever since I got my hands on this electric drill, everything has been so much easier. I can't imagine life without it!\\\"\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"So why wait? Upgrade your toolbox today and experience the power of our electric drill. Don't let anything stand in your way \\u2013 drill like a pro with our electric drill!\\\"\\n\\n[The ad ends with a shot of the electric drill and the brand logo, along with a voiceover announcing a special promotion or discount for a limited time.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Visit our website or your nearest store to get your hands on the ultimate electric drill today. Don't miss out on our special offer \\u2013 drill smarter, not harder!\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 317}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720126130, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNfmHoLLigSaHAbtzv7I1CdcU3hZ\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a happy baby playing with toys in a bright, colorful nursery.