_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 320}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720126992, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNtg8Nd0RL6KJknsGB9qjuzmHK0E\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a washing machine\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens on a busy family home with kids running around and parents trying to keep up with the chaos. The camera zooms in on a pile of dirty laundry overflowing from a basket.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Tired of spending hours doing laundry? Introducing the all-new UltraClean Washing Machine - the ultimate solution to your laundry woes!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a sleek and modern washing machine in the corner of the laundry room, with a bright display screen and various settings.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"With its state-of-the-art technology, the UltraClean Washing Machine provides a superior clean in half the time. Say goodbye to stains and odors with the power of steam cleaning.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of the washing machine in action, as it effortlessly tackles tough stains and leaves clothes looking fresh and clean.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"And with its large capacity, you can now do fewer loads of laundry and spend more time with your loved ones. The UltraClean Washing Machine is designed to make your life easier.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a happy family folding freshly washed laundry together, smiling and laughing.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Don't let laundry day be a chore. Upgrade to the UltraClean Washing Machine and experience the difference today!\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the UltraClean logo and contact information displayed.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"UltraClean - Making laundry a breeze.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 273}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720126996, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNtkOM26zMb3OaD5JZEhIDQ8tzFo\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting dishwasher tablets\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a busy kitchen, dirty dishes piled high in the sink. A frustrated woman stands in