ll guide you through each session, helping you to connect your mind, body, and soul.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a woman smiling and stretching in a yoga pose.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Whether you're a seasoned yogi or a beginner, our classes are suitable for all levels. Come as you are and leave feeling refreshed and rejuvenated.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the serene studio space, with candles and plants creating a peaceful atmosphere.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Join us at Zen Yoga Studio and start your journey to a healthier, happier you. Book your class today.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black, with the Zen Yoga Studio logo and contact information displayed.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Zen Yoga Studio. Where inner peace meets physical wellness.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 231}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720127307, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hNylF1hYBx3NWhMFaD3eu7otivC4\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[Scene opens with a close-up shot of a barbell loaded with weights. Camera pans out to show a gym setting with people working out in the background]\\n\\nNarrator: Are you ready to take your fitness to the next level? Do you want to sculpt your body and build strength like never before?\\n\\n[Cut to footage of a group of people attending a weightlifting class, sweating and lifting weights]\\n\\nNarrator: Then look no further! Our weightlifting class is designed to help you achieve your fitness goals and unleash your full potential.\\n\\n[Cut to a trainer demonstrating proper form and technique for various weightlifting exercises]\\n\\nTrainer: Our experienced trainers will guide you every step of the way, ensuring you have the knowledge and support you need to succeed.\\n\\n[Cut to footage of participants high-fiving each other and cheering each other on]\\n\\nNarrator: Join our community of motivated individuals who are all working towards a common goal - a stronger, he