e background]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Introducing the newest innovation in baby care - SuperSoft Nappies!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of the SuperSoft Nappies packaging]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"With its ultra-absorbent core and soft, stretchy waistband, SuperSoft Nappies are designed to keep your baby dry and comfortable all day long.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different families using SuperSoft Nappies - changing diapers, playing with their babies, and enjoying their time together]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Say goodbye to leaks and discomfort with SuperSoft Nappies. Perfect for day or night use, they provide ultimate protection for your little one.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a smiling baby wearing SuperSoft Nappies]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Try SuperSoft Nappies today and give your baby the comfort and protection they deserve. Available at your nearest store or online.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the SuperSoft Nappies logo and contact information]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"SuperSoft Nappies - because every baby deserves the best.\\\"\\n\\n[End with a shot of a happy family cuddling their baby]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"SuperSoft Nappies. The perfect choice for your baby's comfort and protection.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 262}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720128018, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hOAERGDqcTjPoUD7IW8sEP4oNPp8\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a science museum\", \"response\": \"[The camera fades in to show a bustling science museum filled with excited children and families exploring various exhibits and interactive displays.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Are you ready to embark on a journey of discovery and wonder? Step inside the [City] Science Museum, where science comes to life!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of children and adults of all ages engaging with hands-on experiments and learning about various scientific concepts.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"From exploring the wonders of outer space to diving deep into the mysteries of the huma