ens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 269}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720128168, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hOCexZfgDgU0sV3uGSA6YYxLoHNF\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Scene opens to a peaceful and serene office setting with soft music playing in the background. A therapist is sitting in a comfortable chair, smiling warmly at the camera.]\\n\\nTherapist: Are you feeling overwhelmed, stressed, or anxious? Do you find yourself struggling with your emotions and unable to cope with the challenges of life?\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of people looking distressed, anxious, and overwhelmed in various situations.]\\n\\nTherapist: It's okay to ask for help. Therapy can provide you with the support and guidance you need to navigate life's ups and downs.\\n\\n[Cut back to the therapist, now holding a tissue box and offering it to the camera.]\\n\\nTherapist: In therapy, you can explore your thoughts and feelings in a safe and non-judgmental space. You can learn coping strategies and develop tools to manage your emotions effectively.\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of people in therapy sessions, looking more relaxed and at ease as they talk to their therapists.]\\n\\nTherapist: Whether you're dealing with depression, anxiety, trauma, or relationship issues, therapy can help you heal and grow. You don't have to suffer alone.\\n\\n[Cut back to the therapist, now looking directly at the camera with a compassionate expression.]\\n\\nTherapist: Take the first step towards a happier and healthier life. Reach out for therapy today.\\n\\n[Text appears on the screen: \\\"Therapy: Your path to healing and growth.\\\"]\\n\\nTherapist: Contact us to schedule your first session. You deserve to feel better.\\n\\n[Fade to black with the contact information for the therapy office displayed on the screen.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Therapy - because your mental health matters.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 336}, {\"unix_timesta