ng various yoga poses.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Are you looking to find balance in your life? Do you want to reduce stress and increase flexibility? Then look no further than our yoga classes!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of a diverse group of people of all ages and backgrounds participating in a yoga class, smiling and enjoying themselves.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"At our studio, we offer a variety of classes for all levels, from beginners to advanced practitioners. Our experienced instructors will guide you through a series of poses and breathing exercises to help you relax and rejuvenate your mind, body, and soul.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of a peaceful outdoor setting, with people meditating and practicing yoga amidst nature.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Join us for a transformative experience that will leave you feeling refreshed and revitalized. Whether you're looking to improve your strength, flexibility, or overall well-being, our yoga classes are the perfect way to achieve your goals.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut back to the yoga studio, with a group of people coming together in a circle, smiling and supporting each other.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Don't wait any longer to start your yoga journey. Come join us for a class today and discover the many benefits of this ancient practice. Namaste.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the studio's contact information and class schedule displayed.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Call now to reserve your spot and begin your path to a healthier, happier you. We can't wait to see you on the mat!\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 321}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720128406, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hOGUiaErP8uBO6XeAMY7YfCRTxzw\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot of a gym with people working out in the background]\\n\\nNarrator: Are you tired of feeling tired and out of shape? Do you want to build strength and confidence like never before?\\n\\n[Cut to foo